    "q-36234": {
      "dom_id": "step-q36234",
      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "Compute the rate of change of the function $f(x,y)={x}^{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡y$ with respect to $t$ along the curve $r(t)=⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡t,2t⟩$ at the point $t=\\pi .$",
      "worked_solution": "The rate of change of $f(x,y,z)$ with respect to $t$ along the curve $r(t)$ is given by $\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}[f(r(t))].$ To calculate this, we can use the chain rule.\n\nThe chain rule in vector form states that\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}[f(r(t))]=∇f(r(t))\\cdot {r}^{′}(t).\n$$\n\nFirst, we need to compute $∇f(x,y):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f(x,y) & =⟨\\frac{∂}{∂x}({x}^{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡y),\\frac{∂}{∂y}({x}^{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡y)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2x\\operatorname{sin}⁡y,{x}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡y⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we substitute $x=\\operatorname{ln}⁡t$ and $y=2t$ into the above to find $∇f(r(t)):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f(r(t)) & =⟨2\\operatorname{ln}⁡t\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t,{ln}^{2}⁡t\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we calculate the derivative of $r(t),$ which is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡t),\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(2t)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{1}{t},2⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApplying the chain rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}[f(r(t))] & =∇f(r(t))\\cdot {r}^{′}(t) \\\\  & =⟨2\\operatorname{ln}⁡t\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t,{ln}^{2}⁡t\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t⟩\\cdot ⟨\\frac{1}{t},2⟩ \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{ln}⁡t\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t\\cdot \\frac{1}{t}+{ln}^{2}⁡t\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡t\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t}{t}+2{ln}^{2}⁡t\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the rate of change of $f$ along the curve $r(t)$ at $t=\\pi $ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}[f(r(\\pi ))] & =\\frac{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡\\pi \\operatorname{sin}⁡2\\pi }{\\pi }+2{ln}^{2}⁡\\pi \\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\pi  \\\\  & =2{ln}^{2}⁡\\pi .\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-36234-a",
